      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793685687367,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User can search places (specific & nearby) (Geospatial Indexing)\n`3. Get route for point A to point B with different modes:\n    - Car, Bike, Walk etc.\n4. Near realtime ETA calculations\n5. Live traffic updates for a route.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User can search places (specific & nearby) (Geospatial Indexing)\n`3. Get route for point A to point B with different modes:\n    - Car, Bike, Walk etc.\n4. Near realtime ETA calculations\n5. Live traffic updates for a route.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
