      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793685687367,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Low latency for searching and map rendering\n2. High availability\n3. Read heavy for map, route, ETA etc.\n4. Write heavy for Location update, Traffic update etc.",
